  (uuid "2da895a2-6ea3-58f2-90d9-d3f761e3d58e")
  (paper "A2")
  (title_block
    (title "Bass amp power amplifier: 2 x LM3886T bridged (BTL), protection")
    (rev "1")
    (comment 1 "BRIDGED OUTPUT: neither speaker terminal is ground. Use a Speakon NL4 (1+ = SPK+, 1- = SPK-).")
    (comment 2 "Rails +/-28 V from the PSU board with heavy wire. Star ground at the PSU reservoir caps.")
    (comment 3 "Heatsink <= 0.4 C/W (or <= 0.7 C/W + fan). LM3886T tab is V-: insulate it.")
    (comment 4 "J5 goes to the phones jack NC switch (opens = speaker muted). Fit a jumper if unused.")
  )
